t/pulls/104210","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-03-19T10:43:33Z"},{"id":2702459596,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hFELM","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?u=4854f17c9d330a8a9d274f0cb7b943fc2bb6dd44&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","login":"smix8","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104210#pullrequestreview-2702459596","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104210","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-03-20T12:10:52Z"},{"id":2702557019,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hFb9b","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6639237?u=89d4350f70d480d0457417ef122a7aaa1bb633f7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/MJacred","id":6639237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzkyMzc=","login":"MJacred","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104210#pullrequestreview-2702557019","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104210","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-03-20T12:39:08Z"},{"id":2846402830,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6pqKkO","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6639237?u=89d4350f70d480d0457417ef122a7aaa1bb633f7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/MJacred","id":6639237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzkyMzc=","login":"MJacred","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred"},"body":"I tested with two planes of the size 1000x1000 with 100 subdivisions, in order to slow down the generation.\r\n\r\nbugs\r\n* Clicking \"cancel\" in the dialog only closes the dialog, it does not cancel the current baking The navmeshes still show up\r\n* the bug I mentioned previously is still there: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104210#pullrequestreview-2694159580\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nJust something I noticed…  \r\nAs far as I can tell, `NavMeshGeneratorTask3D::TaskStatus::BAKING_FAILED` is never used. Anywhere in the engine.  \r\ne.g. `NavMeshGenerator3D::generator_bake_from_source_geometry_data` could return that value, which could be used in the calling func `NavMeshGenerator3D::generator_thread_bake` to update `generator_task->status`","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104210#pullrequestreview-2846402830","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104210","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-05-16T11:53:07Z"},{"id":2854798814,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6qKMXe","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"7ae2c0af9dfcc88689476b5ad35d16f28c4b7aea","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6639237?u=89d4350f70d480d0457417ef122a7aaa1bb633f7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/MJacred","id":6639237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzkyMzc=","login":"MJacred","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred"},"body":"> That the baking does no longer work after cancelling once at the very begin should be fixed now.\r\n\r\nFix is confirmed.\r\n\r\n> The cancel can only cancel queued navmeshes after the currently baked navmesh\r\n\r\nYou're right, I mixed that up with my tests on non-unique nav regions. Sorry for the confusion.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nrefinement suggestions:\r\n* adding to the dialog the note: \"Cancelling takes effect after the currently baking region is finished.\" (or sth. along the lines)\r\n* change button text from \"Cancel\" to \"Close\" when there's only 1 unique navmesh, as actually cancelling is impossible in that context","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104210#pullrequestreview-2854798814","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104210","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-05-20T16:04:51Z"},{"id":2913839291,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6trai7","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"7ae2c0af9dfcc88689476b5ad35d16f28c4b7aea","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"YOLO approved.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104210#pullrequestreview-2913839291","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104210","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-10T14:27:40Z"}]